Ah! It's gone! You're back, you're back!

2240
01:34:39,144 --> 01:34:40,144
のじゃー
Yeah~

2241
01:34:40,144 --> 01:34:41,344
今ので取れたよ！
It came off just now!

2242
01:34:41,344 --> 01:34:42,444
