Crap, I can't move.

2393
01:40:22,260 --> 01:40:23,660
どうしようかな
What should I do?

2394
01:40:24,560 --> 01:40:25,960
どうしようかな
What should I do?

2395
01:40:30,160 --> 01:40:31,160
よいしょ
All right.

2396
