浮かすやつ来た！
The floating guy is here!

2829
01:55:00,234 --> 01:55:01,284
やばい、浮かすやつ…
Oh crap, the floating one...

2830
01:55:01,284 --> 01:55:01,584
ん？
Hm?

2831
