え、何？
Huh, what?

2843
01:55:24,984 --> 01:55:25,784
でっか！
It's huge!

2844
01:55:25,784 --> 01:55:27,384
二人でも無理かな？
Is it too much even for two people?

2845
01:55:27,384 --> 01:55:28,884
